# Packages
*.tar
*.zip
*.gzip
*.gz
*.bz2
*.deb

# Run artefacts. Driving an h-* command or a test from the repo root drops its log here, and one
# already reached a PR that way. Nothing tracked ends in .log, so this masks no real file.
*.log

# Editors
.vs/
.nova/
.idea/
.env

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# Composer
composer.phar

# Ad-hoc lint tooling: run against a checkout, never part of the build. Caches carry absolute paths
# and tool versions, and a tracked one would also land in the release tarball.
.php-cs-fixer.cache
.phpstan.cache
.phpunit.result.cache

# Instance data: custom panel themes (never shipped)
web/css/src/themes/custom/

# Claude
.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
tests/
